{
  "total_ms": 59770,
  "total_chars": 243,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "洪水冲过来，实心的桥身一堵，水劲全憋在一处；可河北有座桥，偏在大券的肩膀上开了小券，硬是站了一千四百多年——这就是赵州桥。",
      "chars": 61,
      "speech_ms": 15060,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 15060,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "相传主持修桥的匠人叫李春，是隋代人。",
      "chars": 18,
      "speech_ms": 3990,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 15460,
      "end_ms": 19450,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "它了不起的地方就在于这几个小券：桥肩不再是实心的，这叫敞肩拱，赵州桥是隋代首创。",
      "chars": 40,
      "speech_ms": 9850,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 19850,
      "end_ms": 29700,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "好处实在：一是桥身轻了，自重小了；",
      "chars": 17,
      "speech_ms": 3970,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 30100,
      "end_ms": 34070,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "二是发洪水时，水能从小券分流，不至于全压在桥身上。",
      "chars": 25,
      "speech_ms": 5260,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 34470,
      "end_ms": 39730,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "当然要说清：这桥历代都大修过，现存桥石多非隋代原石。",
      "chars": 26,
      "speech_ms": 5850,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 40130,
      "end_ms": 45980,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "可敞肩拱这个桥型、这份巧思，是实实在在从隋代传下来的。",
      "chars": 27,
      "speech_ms": 6340,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 46380,
      "end_ms": 52720,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "一座桥活一千四百年，靠的不是料有多金贵，是设计先想明白了。",
      "chars": 29,
      "speech_ms": 6240,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 53120,
      "end_ms": 59360,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}